As discussed in our coordination meeting last week, attached are the revised shielding specifications for the MRI and CT imaging suites at the Eastside Medical Pavilion.

Key changes from the previous issue:
- MRI suite: Increased to 1/8" lead equivalent at all walls (was 1/16" at corridor walls per RFI-014)
