2. Electrical - RF filter panel at MRI room penetrations
3. HVAC - non-ferrous ductwork within 5-gauss line

Please update your procurement schedule accordingly. The lead-lined drywall is the critical path item - we need the order placed by May 1st to maintain the imaging suite completion date.

